        "data": {
          "comment": "# Rewrite This So a Customer Understands It\n\nRewrites technical text in plain language for a general reader. Use it for help articles, release notes, or support replies that start full of jargon.\n\n**How it works:** \"Input\" takes the text to simplify. \"Agent\" rewrites it at roughly a UK Year 9 reading level, keeping every fact and explaining jargon inline. \"Output\" returns the plain-English version.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Agent\", then change its system prompt to target a different reader, such as a new employee in finance."
